@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
left to right direction
actor Student
actor Lecturer
actor Administrator
rectangle Discivium {
 usecase "UC1 Publish assignment" as U1
 usecase "UC2 Submit assignment" as U2
 usecase "UC3 Release feedback" as U3
 usecase "UC4 View coursework" as U4
 usecase "UC5 Download submission" as U5
 usecase "UC6 View feedback" as U6
 usecase "UC7 Enroll student" as U7
 usecase "UC8 View notifications" as U8
}
Lecturer -- U1
Student -- U2
Lecturer -- U3
Student -- U4
Lecturer -- U4
Student -- U5
Lecturer -- U5
Student -- U6
Administrator -- U7
Student -- U8
Lecturer -- U8
@enduml
